# NOTICE

This module is a partial fork of the LogQL parser packages from Grafana Loki:

- https://github.com/grafana/loki — `pkg/logql/syntax`, `pkg/logql/log`,
  `pkg/logql/log/jsonexpr`, `pkg/logql/log/logfmt`, `pkg/logql/log/pattern`,
  and trimmed extracts of `pkg/logqlmodel`, `pkg/util`, and
  `pkg/util/constants`.

The original Loki source is Copyright Grafana Labs and licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See `LICENSE` for the full license text.

This fork exists to provide a LogQL parser without inheriting Loki's
runtime/distribution dependencies (`grafana/dskit`, `etcd`, `jaeger`, etc.).
Files in `syntax/`, `log/`, and `log/*/` are copied near-verbatim from Loki,
with import paths rewritten and unused transitive dependencies removed.
`logqlmodel/` is a trimmed reimplementation of the Loki package by the same
name; the `Result` and `Streams` types are intentionally omitted.

Modifications by Qualithm to this fork are also released under Apache 2.0.
